      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Outlaws? No, N'guth would never have fallen to those types.\n\n[He takes the dog tags from you and inspects them.] I can't believe he's gone. The only ones who could have gotten the best of him would be those Mandalorians dogs ! [He grabs the key from you.] This must be the key for the facility.\n\nUnfortunately, we don't have a strike team available at the moment. But I assure you we will take care of those Mandalorian scum!",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
