      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Would you do that? For Czerka, you must avenge Captain N'guth! \n\nKill every last one of those Mandalorian raiders! [He hands the key back to you.] \n\nTake down their leader and the rest will fall too. You better gather a squad for this, It won't be easy. ",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
